      m_Calls: []
  m_text: "Vesna Vulovic was a Serbian flight attendant who became famous for surviving
    the highest fall without a parachute ever recorded. \r\nOn 26 January 1972, she
    was the sole survivor of JAT Flight 367, which broke up in mid-air after an explosion
    over Czechoslovakia; the wreckage fell from about 10,160 m. Vulovi\u0107 suffered
    severe injuries but remarkably recovered, later becoming a Guinness World Records
    holder. She died in 2016 at age 66.\r\n"
  m_isRightToLeft: 0
  m_fontAsset: {fileID: 11400000, guid: 7bb02f5e3ca3a9e4caacb46d8d93890b, type: 2}
